# Local-only secrets for `wrangler dev` (copy to .dev.vars, which is gitignored).
# In production this is set with: wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#
# Optional: enables real AI-generated narrative insights instead of the
# built-in template-based fallback. Get a key from https://console.anthropic.com
# Leave unset to run fully offline with no external calls.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
